%% Outbound call. Source: app/main.py:110-129. After Twilio connects, flow is identical to feature-inbound-call.
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as You (curl)
    participant API as main.outbound_call
    participant TWR as Twilio REST
    participant Phone as Your phone
    participant MS as WS /media-stream
    U->>API: POST /call {"to": "+91..."} X-Demo-Token
    API->>API: check token (401) + Twilio creds (500)
    API->>TWR: POST /Accounts/SID/Calls.json<br/>To, From, Twiml=stream_twiml(request)
    alt status >= 300
        TWR-->>API: error
        API-->>U: 502 detail
    else ok
        TWR-->>API: {sid, status}
        API-->>U: 200 {call_sid, status}
        TWR->>Phone: rings
        Phone-->>TWR: answered
        TWR->>MS: opens Media Stream (see feature-inbound-call)
    end
